pty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Dafty in the middle.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/e7/Dafty_in_the_middle..png/revision/latest?cb=20221013075126\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Dafty in the middle.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/e7/Dafty_in_the_middle..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20221013075126\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/e7/Dafty_in_the_middle..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20221013075126 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/e7/Dafty_in_the_middle..png/revision/latest?cb=20221013075126 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Dafty in the middle.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Dafty_in_the_middle..png\" data-image-name=\"Dafty in the middle..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_14\" title=\"Series 14\">14</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/John_Kearns\" title=\"John Kearns\">John Kearns</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enormous_hugeness.\" title=\"Enormous hugeness.\">Enormous hugeness.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crumbs_in_my_bralette.\" title=\"Crumbs in my bralette.\">Crumbs in my bralette.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Dafty in the middle.</b></i> is the third episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_14\" title=\"Series 14\">Series 14</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 13 October 2022. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/John_Kearns\" title=\"John Kearns\">John Kearns</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Dafty_in_the_middle.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Dafty in the middle\" was how <a href=\"/wiki/Fern_Brady\" title=\"Fern Brady\">Fern Brady</a> referred to <a href=\"/wiki/John_Kearns\" title=\"John Kearns\">John Kearns</a>, during the <a href=\"/wiki/Put_the_most_sand_in_the_shopping_trolley\" title=\"Put the most sand in the shopping trolley\">Put the most sand in the shopping trolley</a> task. The title card is of a beach ball on a sand ice-cream. The sand is a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Put_the_most_sand_in_the_shopping_trolley\" title=\"Put the most sand in the shopping trolley\">Put the most sand in the shopping trolley</a> task, while the ice cream cone is a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Identify_the_ice_cream_flavours\" title=\"Identify the ice cream flavours\">Identify the ice cream flavours</a> task. The beach ball is presumably a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Catch_something\" title=\"Catch something\">Catch something</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Dafty_in_the_middle.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Tumpen i midten', which translates as 'Dunce in the middle'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Älykääpio remmissä', which translates as 'Half-wit in the group'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Händerna på höften', which translates as 'Hands on hips'. This is also a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Put_the_most_sand_in_the_shopping_trolley\" title=\"Put the most sand in the shopping trolley\">Put the most sand in the shopping trolley</a> task.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Den treige i midten', which translates as 'The slow one in the middle'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Dafty_in_the_middle.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Dara_%C3%93_Briain\" title=\"Dara Ó Briain\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Dara Ó Briain</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Fern_Brady\" title=\"Fern Brady\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Fern Brady</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/John_Kearns\" title=\"John Kearns\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">John Kearns</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Munya_Chawawa\" title=\"Munya Chawawa\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Munya Chawawa</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Millican\" title=\"Sarah Millican\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sarah Millican</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_thing_that_you_most_want_on_a_Sunday_morning\" title=\"The thing that you most want on a Sunday morning\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The thing that you most want on a Sunday morning.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/Put_the_most_sand_in_the_shopping_trolley\" title=\"Put the most sand in the shopping trolley\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Place half your hands on half your hips and leave them there until the second part of the task is over. Also, the hands that are on hips must only touch those hips until the second part of the task is over.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">0\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">0\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">0\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Team:</b> With your hands on those hips at all times, put the most sand in the shopping trolley. You may only move the shopping trolley when there is one minute left on the clock.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Sabotage your team in the next task. If your team loses the task, you win five points. If your team wins the task, you win zero points. If your team accuses you of sabotaging the task, you win zero points.\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Identify_the_ice_cream_flavours\" title=\"Identify the ice cream flavours\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Identify the ice cream flavours. You must find every flavour delicious.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Catch_something\" title=\"Catch something\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Catch something.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Predict_whether_an_item_will_create_a_higher_or_lower_number_of_decibels_than_the_previous_item\" title=\"Predict whether an item will create a higher or lower number of decibels than the previous item\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Predict whether an item will create a higher or lower number of decibels than the previous item. If you are wrong, you are out.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">20\n</td>\n<td>11\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Dafty_in_the_middle.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/dafty-middle\"><i>Dafty in the middle.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/70915-003\"><i>Dafty in the middle.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141517\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.103 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 776/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26036/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 174/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800541/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   63.606      1 -total\n 46.24%   29.413      1 Template:Spoilers\n 44.63%   28.389      1 Template:MessageBox\n 25.83%   16.427      1 Template:Episode_infobox\n 23.07%   14.672 